  "statement": "A sequence is defined by \\(a_{0}=1\\) and \\(a_{n}=2^{a_{n-1}}\\) for \\(n \\geq 1\\). What is the last digit (in base 10) of \\(a_{15}\\) ?",
  "answerChoices": [],
